<title>MALAYSIA: Antah Holdings year net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Antah Holdings year net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    28.14	   vs	  25.47</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)   12.29	   vs	  11.55</p>
<p>    Turnover	     828.49	   vs	 717.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	43.80	   vs	  39.28</p>
<p>    Minorities less	1.95	   vs   less  5.15</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries loss 5.94	   vs	   4.90</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Antah Holdings Bhd. It is involved in management, distribution of consumer products, property development and other activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
